            "review_title": "Review at BÚP Cafe",
            "review_text": "Givparis\nLondon, United Kingdom60 contributions\n0\nOne of the best food spots in Hoi An!!!!\nJun 2019 • Friends\nLoved everything about this special little cafe. Owners were so kind and made us feel constantly welcome! Owner even kept the place open later for us one night! True legend. \n\nStayed in Hoi An for 5 nights, visited this cafe 6 times! Literally trumped everywhere else we ate. The value for food was unparalleled, cheap and extremely tasty with good portion sizes. \n\nBUP cafe added to my entire experience in Vietnam and made it just that more special :) \n\nWhen I next visit Hoi An you can be certain that this little cafe will be my first food destination!\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2019",
